cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MyoMeasure, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "MyoMeasure: A new operator-independent pipeline for myotube diameter measurement"
abstract: >-
  An operator-independent, one-command pipeline for myotube diameter
  measurement in C2C12 cultures, combining Cellpose-SAM segmentation with
  skeleton-based perpendicular ray-casting (TRUEFAD sampling).
type: software
